<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Issue Reported Successfully — WardFlow</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }
    .card-success {
      max-width: 460px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.1);
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge-ticket {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-family: monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      background-color: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
      border: 1px solid #86efac;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card-success">
  <div class="mb-3">
    <div class="rounded-circle bg-success-subtle text-success d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
      <i class="bi bi-check2-circle fs-1"></i>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">Issue Reported!</h3>
  <p class="text-muted small mb-2">Your report for <strong><%= assetName %></strong> has been received and logged into WardFlow.</p>

  <div class="badge-ticket fw-bold">
    <%= ticketNumber %>
  </div>

  <p class="small text-muted mb-4">
    The responsible department has been notified according to SLA response targets. Please quote this ticket number if following up.
  </p>

  <div class="d-grid gap-2">
    <button onclick="window.close(); if(!window.closed) window.location.reload();" class="btn btn-outline-success">
      <i class="bi bi-x-circle me-1"></i> Close
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
